        },
        "richtext_faKRYd": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Andrew brings over a decade of teaching experience across the public and private sectors, including international experience in Australia. He is deeply committed to helping students succeed and is known for his strong understanding of the Ontario curriculum and personalized approach to learning. Andrew has taught English, Social Science, and Co-operative Education. Outside of the classroom, he enjoys traveling and spending time with his wife and children.</p>"
