          }
        },
        "richtext_ztCkt8": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>With 16 years of teaching experience, Adam has a strong track record of helping students reach their full potential. Known for his engaging approach and ability to support different learning styles, he has taught a wide range of courses including General Science, Biology, Physical Education, and Math. Outside the classroom, Adam is also a two-time OFSSAA champion hockey coach and can often be found coaching on the field, the rink, or the diamond.</p>"
          }
