      "blocks": {
        "heading_ynHy3b": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Why Ontario Education Online?",
            "heading_tag": "h1",
            "text_color": "",
            "gradient": ""
          }
        },
        "richtext_r8hdMr": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>As educators and coaches, we've had the privilege of working with diverse students over the years. We've coached athletes, supported extracurricular activities, and have seen firsthand the challenges that students face when trying to juggle their education with busy schedules.</p><p>We founded Ontario Education Online with one simple yet powerful idea in mind – to provide Ontario students with the flexibility they need to succeed. We believe that education should adapt to the students, not the other way around. Whether you're a student seeking to earn extra credits, thrive in an online learning environment, or are engaged in demanding extracurricular activities, we've got you covered.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
